Subject: [PATCH 77/78] vk_device: NX2NAVI_VMA_BLOCK_MIB=n (default 0: VMA's
 256 MiB) sets the size of VMA's memory blocks in large heaps, so partly used
 blocks empty and go back sooner; the VRAM headroom check uses the same size
 (#160)

